{"s":94,"name":"سُورَةُ الشَّرۡحِ","en_name":"Ash-Sharh","ar":["أَلَمْ نَشْرَحْ لَكَ صَدْرَكَ","وَوَضَعْنَا عَنكَ وِزْرَكَ","ٱلَّذِىٓ أَنقَضَ ظَهْرَكَ","وَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَ","فَإِنَّ مَعَ ٱلْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا","إِنَّ مَعَ ٱلْعُسْرِ يُسْرًۭا","فَإِذَا فَرَغْتَ فَٱنصَبْ","وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَٱرْغَب"],"en":["Have We not caused thy bosom to dilate,","And eased thee of the burden","Which weighed down thy back;","And exalted thy fame?","But lo! with hardship goeth ease,","Lo! with hardship goeth ease;","So when thou art relieved, still toil","And strive to please thy Lord."],"src":"api.alquran.cloud quran-uthmani + en.pickthall","lw":[[2,10,22,8,32],[27,18,22,3,13],[1,25,22,3,12],[27,1,22,3,12],[20,23,1,4,14],[1,18,1,4,13],[20,19,2,3,13],[27,2,2,3,12]],"lw_src":"Quran Recorder wardrobe.js + quran-text.js @6bac659"}